<h3><u>abbas aajao</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>aakhri salaam<br />
maqtal me pahonche jab shaahe wala<br />
laashe jawaan aur khaimon ko dekha<br />
darya ko dekha phir ye pukaara<br />
ab ye salaame aakhir hai mera</p>

<p>abbas aajaawo bhaayi akela hai<br />
tanha musaafir ko laakhon ne ghera hai</p>

<p>tumne na dekhi ghurbat hamaari<br />
zainab thi laayi meri sawaari<br />
rukhsat ka meri manzar ajab tha<br />
sine se lag jaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>

<p>jab se ho bichre abbas ham se<br />
ehle haram hai lipte alam se<br />
kaise jiyegi baali sakina<br />
kya hoga batlaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>

<p>lashkar kahaan ka jab tum nahi ho<br />
aada to khush hain ab tum nahi ho<br />
kitna akela kitna hun tanha<br />
sine me hai ghaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>

<p>din bhar uthaaye kitne janaaze<br />
ab kaun hai jo dega dilaase<br />
hote agar tum dete dilaasa<br />
aaawo chale aaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>

<p>mujh par baraste ye sang dekho<br />
bekas ki tanha ki jang dekho<br />
dekho na tute nana se waada<br />
himmat barha jaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>

<p>jab shimr khanjar ko pherta tha<br />
qaatil ne shaah se khud ye sunaa tha<br />
pyaasa gala us dam ye pukaara<br />
surat dikha jaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>

<p>sar sheh ka aaya noke sina par<br />
aayi sada ye rehaan o sarwar<br />
be sar parha hai bhaayi ka laasha<br />
ab to chale aaawo bhaayi akela hai</p>
</p>
